00:01:18.196 --> 00:01:19.340
It's all some people have.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.302
It's all that gives them hope.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:26.020
People hate what they don't understand.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.180
Be their hero, Clark,

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.300
