00:01:37.672 --> 00:01:39.672
You don't owe this world a thing,

00:01:39.672 --> 00:01:41.412
you never did.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.600
Do you know the oldest lie in America, Senator?

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.260
Devils don't come from hell beneath us,

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.900
they come from the sky.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.720
Twenty year in Gotham,

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.320
how many good guys are left?

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.720
How many stayed that way?

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:02.100
He has the power to wipe out the entire human race.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.060
I only have to destroy him.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.540
You're gonna cause a war.

00:02:37.275 --> 00:02:39.275
He is not our enemy.

00:02:44.725 --> 00:02:46.725
Black and blue.

00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:49.801
God versus man.

00:02:51.018 --> 00:02:53.018
The day versus night.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.200
The red capes are coming.

