00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.860
He said the most agreegeous thing that he changed

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:52.460
is that now Metropolis exists right next to Gotham City.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.680
As in like, they're separated by a bay.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.120
And in the wake of Superman's battle with the other kryptonians, with Zod,

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:02.700
it's become this, you know,
very much prosperous versus decrepit city.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:06.140
